    "description": "The Events Ticketing History Retrieval API allows businesses to access the historical data of tickets in the event ticketing system. Through this endpoint, users can retrieve comprehensive records of all ticket transactions, enabling them to analyze sales performance and customer engagement over time. This API is particularly useful for event organizers, ticketing platforms, and stakeholders who need insights into past events and ticketing trends. Developers can integrate this API to enhance reporting tools or to inform marketing strategies based on historical patterns.",
